{"id":"8ebdea3e9c19b1bf","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-lowforcomputable.md","title":"可计算随机低性","display":"df-lowforcomputable — 可计算随机低性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-lowforcomputable","aliases":["43-df-lowforcomputable"],"display":"df-lowforcomputable — 可计算随机低性","depends_on":["[[43-df-comprandom]]","[[43-df-rel-comprandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"§16.5, printed p.506 / PDF p.526","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-lowforcomputable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-lowforcomputable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lowforcomputable — 可计算随机低性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4a7907a385b0f04\" href=\"?note=b4a7907a385b0f04\" title=\"43-df-rel-comprandom\">43-df-rel-comprandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§16.5, printed p.506 / PDF p.526"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4a7907a385b0f04\" href=\"?note=b4a7907a385b0f04\" title=\"43-df-rel-comprandom\">43-df-rel-comprandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForComputable}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A(X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForComputable}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A(X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>无预言机鞅能由任意预言机模拟，因此相对随机类总包含于原随机类；公式中的单向蕴含正好表达两类相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-comprandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"b4a7907a385b0f04","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-comprandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-comprandom]]，$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A$ 见 [[43-df-rel-comprandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"b4a7907a385b0f04","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-comprandom]]，$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A$ 见 [[43-df-rel-comprandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowForComputable}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A(X)].","display":true}],"bytes":1085,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-389","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforcomputable]] — 可计算随机低性"},{"id":"b029734fc0b3cad0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是其特征函数。$\\mathrm{LowForComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforcomputable]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。"}],"outgoing":["52fd5856a06d2543","b4a7907a385b0f04"]}